.TH PRODBOX_lifecycle_authority 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-lifecycle-authority \- Dedicated lifecycle-authority runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox lifecycle-authority
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for the physically separated lifecycle-authority process.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBstart\fR
Start lifecycle-authority
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBprodbox lifecycle-authority start --config /etc/lifecycle-authority/config/config.dhall\fR
Start lifecycle-authority.
